---
import Layout from "../Layout/Layout.astro"
import AstraPic from "../assets/Astra.jpg"
import CharliPic from "../assets/Charli.jpg"
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import InLine from "../Components/InLine.astro";

const citations = [
    {
        Inline: "1",
        mla: "LifeTouch, “Knapp Senior Photos”, 2025",
    },
    {
        Inline: "2",
        mla: "Huang, “Golfing”, 2024",
    }
]
---


<Layout title="About" Citations={citations}>
    <div class="u-container">

        <div class="Column-personal flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10">
            <div class="Profile">
                <Image src={AstraPic} class="Profile-Photo" alt="Astra Photo" fetchpriority="high"/>
                <InLine Citation={citations[0]}/>
                <span class="spacer"/>
                <h1 class="Name" data-sy-reveal="words">Astra Knapp</h1>
                <span class="spacer"/>
                <p class="Profile-Bio" data-sy-reveal="lines">A student at Junipero Serra High School, in their senior year. Has taken part in many different clubs and activities at serra, including Robotics, Mock Trial, Ethics Bowl and Track and Field.</p>
                <span class="spacer"/>
                <p class="Profile-Bio" data-sy-reveal="lines">
                    Throughout my time at Serra, the ideals of care and health have been discussed greatly. Doing activities like the Junior Urban Plunge has shown me the value of caring for those in need. Additionally, I’ve participated in Ethics Bowl, in which I discussed many moral issues. These activities have shown me just how much care people in the world need, and made me much more conscious of the suffering of those around me. Through this website, I hope to be able to inform many more people about the struggles faced by so many trans people on a daily basis.
                </p>
                <span class="spacer"/>
                <p class="Profile-Bio" data-sy-reveal="lines">I care because I know many people that are affected by this issue. I’ve seen the suffering caused by this injustice, and have seen it firsthand. A lack of healthcare for trans people makes their lives so much harder. Not only do they have to go through personal battles with friends and family, but they also have to fight against healthcare companies who do see the value in their lives. These companies actively stop trans people from being themselves, and make it extremely hard for them to get the support they need. Many people die on waiting lists or while battling with their health insurance to get the care they need.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="Profile">
                <Image src={CharliPic} class="Profile-Photo" alt="Charli Photo" fetchpriority="high"/>
                <InLine Citation={citations[1]}/>
                <span class="spacer"/>
                <h1 class="Name" data-sy-reveal="words">Huang</h1>
                <span class="spacer"/>
                <p class="Profile-Bio" data-sy-reveal="lines">Senior at Junipero Serra High School. </p>
                <span class="spacer"></span>
                <p class="Profile-Bio" data-sy-reveal="lines">
                    I’ve spent lots of time volunteering to help the marginalized and learning about virtues and ethics through classes at Serra. 
                    I’ve also written about issues adjacent to this through the Serra Friar as a freelancer reporter.
                </p>
                <span class="spacer"/>
                <p class="Profile-Bio" data-sy-reveal="lines">There are many close people in my life who are affected by the lack of healthcare, but also the general culture that supports harm toward transgender people. Already, they are made to feel worse about themselves for being who they are, and this increasing reduction in accessibility for healthcare makes it impossible for them to even work towards being themselves.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>

    .Column-personal {

        align-items: start;
        align-content: center;
        vertical-align: top;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 8rem 0 4rem;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        text-align: center;
        height: 100%;


    }
    .Name {
        max-width: 10em;
        line-height: 1;
        font-size: 2rem;
        align-self: center;
        align-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: justify;

    }
    .Profile {
        padding-left: 50px;
        padding-right: 50px;
        align-items: center;
        flex-direction: column;
        display: flex;
    }
    .Profile-Photo {
        height: 300px;
        width: 300px;
        z-index: 10;
        border-radius: 50%;
        object-fit: cover;
    }
    .Profile-Bio {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: normal;
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 400px;
        //text-align-last: justify;
    }
</style>